    <briefdescription>
<para>Abstract base for the predictor-corrector path-tracker hierarchy. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The single virtual entry point <computeroutput><ref refid="class_homotopy_a8cdcc093f711671949312489f2e55134_1a8cdcc093f711671949312489f2e55134" kindref="member">track()</ref></computeroutput> walks columns of <computeroutput>inputs</computeroutput> (each carrying an initial solution plus the start value of the continuation parameter <computeroutput>t</computeroutput> in its last coordinate) toward target values, writing the result into <computeroutput>outputs</computeroutput> and per-path status into <computeroutput>output_extras</computeroutput>. Implementation lives in <computeroutput><ref refid="class_homotopy_concrete" kindref="compound">HomotopyConcrete</ref>&lt;RT, Algorithm&gt;</computeroutput> with <computeroutput>Algorithm</computeroutput> chosen by the <computeroutput><ref refid="struct_homotopy_algorithm" kindref="compound">HomotopyAlgorithm</ref>&lt;RT&gt;</computeroutput> traits class above. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
